 2011 年处理过 3289 例洗澡时…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"标记：喝了酒别泡温泉、蒸桑拿，回家也别泡热水澡"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"已做到"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"加入待做"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"收藏"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"分享这条建议"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["不花钱。喝了酒就改天再去泡，回家只简单冲个淋浴。难在温泉、桑拿常常是聚餐后的下一场，一桌人都去，你得开口说不去。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["芬兰把 1990 到 2002 年死在桑拿房里的人逐例查过，用的是警方和法医的报告。这类死亡每年不到 10 万分之 2，原文说「总体上 50% 的人处在酒精作用下」。作者说酒精这个风险在变大，预防重点是少喝酒，别把喝醉的人单独留在桑拿房。东京法医 2009 到 2011 年处理过 3289 例洗澡时死亡。其中做了尸检的 550 例里，140 例血液酒精超过每毫升 0.5 毫克，约占四分之一。东京另一份尸检记录有 77 例浴缸溺死，促成溺水的因素里醉酒最多（25 例），其次是心脏病（22 例）。日本消费者厅 2025 年 12 月的提醒说，2024 年日本有 7776 人在浴缸里溺死，其中 65 岁以上 7363 人。防事故的要点写着：刚吃完饭、喝了酒、吃了药之后别泡澡。中国驻日本使馆提醒「酒后不宜入浴」，因为「酒后入浴易引发心脏或血管系统急病」。陕西省卫健委的科普说，酒后泡温泉，高水温会让血管扩张，可能出现低血压、低血糖，甚至晕倒"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Kenttämies A, Karkola K (2008). Death in sauna. Journal of Forensic Sciences, 53(3), 724-729. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1556-4029.2008.00703.x","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1556-4029.2008.00703.x"]},"；Suzuki H, Hikiji W, Tanifuji T, Abe N, Fukunaga T (2015). Characteristics of sudden bath-related death investigated by medical examiners in Tokyo, Japan. Journal of Epidemiology, 25(2), 126-132. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.2188/jea.JE20140068","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.2188/jea.JE20140068"]},"；Mishima S, Suzuki H, Fukunaga T, Nishitani Y (2018). Postmortem computed tomography findings in cases of bath-related death: applicability and limitation in forensic practice. Forensic Science International, 282, 195-203. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.forsciint.2017.11.030","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1016/j.forsciint.2017.11.030"]},"；消費者庁 (2025). 年末年始、高齢者の事故に注意しましょう!：「食後すぐの入浴や、飲酒後、医薬品服用後の入浴は避けましょう」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.caa.go.jp/policies/policy/consumer_safety/caution/caution_084/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.caa.go.jp/policies/policy/consumer_safety/caution/caution_084/"]},"；中华人民共和国驻日本国大使馆 (2015). 领事提醒之十七：「空腹、满腹、酒后不宜入浴。酒后入浴易引发心脏或血管系统急病」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://jp.china-embassy.gov.cn/chn/jbwzlmnew/lszcnew/LSBHYXZ/LSBHLBZN/201503/t20150327_9475462.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://jp.china-embassy.gov.cn/chn/jbwzlmnew/lszcnew/LSBHYXZ/LSBHLBZN/201503/t20150327_9475462.htm"]},"；陕西省卫生健康委员会 (2021). 温泉泡对了才养生：「切忌酒后或空腹泡温泉，在高水温的刺激下容易引起外周血管扩张出现低血压、低血糖、甚至晕厥」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://sxwjw.shaanxi.gov.cn/ywgz/gbbj/202101/t20210111_2148844.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://sxwjw.shaanxi.gov.cn/ywgz/gbbj/202101/t20210111_2148844.html"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["定 B 是因为这些研究只看了死去的人。喝了酒去泡的人里有多少出事，没人算过，所以说不出风险高几倍。收益定「中」是凭判断：在桑拿房、浴缸里死的人本来不多，但死者里喝过酒的占四分之一到一半。日本浴缸溺死的多是老人，喝了酒的年轻人在桑拿房里一样会出事。平时泡澡的好处和水温、时长的提醒，见第 2 节第 36 条（有条件就泡澡）。同伴喝醉了怎么照看，见第 13 节第 46 条（有人喝醉了）。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/22-10"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"选住处时把周边绿地算进去，但别指望「多去公园」就延寿"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/22-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"滑雪、滑单板、轮滑、骑山地车时戴头盔"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/22-03"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["场子里有人递「东西」就立刻走，容留和提供都不是「帮朋友」"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["娱乐场所不许贩毒、不许提供毒品，也不许留人在里面吸。违反的要停业整顿 3 到 6 个月，重的吊销许可证。在你订的包厢或住处让人「用一下」，可能构成容留他人吸毒罪…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/22-04"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不吃陌生人给的糖和零食，不喝离开过视线的饮料，不接别人递的烟弹"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["现在的毒品不长毒品的样子。掺了合成大麻素的「上头」电子烟，看着和普通电子烟差不多，有人专在酒吧、KTV、宾馆里递给人试。骗人吸的拘留 10 到 15 日并罚款，…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/22-05"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["剧本杀、密室别去开在居民楼里或者地下二层以下的"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["五部门 2022 年的通知写明，剧本娱乐场所不得开在居民楼内，也不得开在地下一层以下。这类场地常常昏暗、通道窄，有的用可燃材料装修，疏散通道还被锁上或者堵住，起…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/22-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["心情差到抑郁的程度，就去走或者跑，抗抑郁的效应量（效果大小）跟强度成正比"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["重度抑郁的人运动，快走或慢跑改善最明显。其次是瑜伽、力量训练、太极气功，几种差距不大。强度开得越高效果越好，力量训练和瑜伽最容易坚持。这方面的证据质量偏低，能确…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/22-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["焦虑到影响生活时，正念减压课的效果不劣于常用的抗焦虑药"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["确诊焦虑障碍的人上 8 周正念减压课，症状改善和吃抗焦虑药艾司西酞普兰几乎一样。吃药的人近八成出过不良反应，有人因此退出。上课的人约一成半出过，没人退出。课得是…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/22-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["当场想缓过来，用 5 分钟「循环叹息」：吸气两段，呼气拉长"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["每天做 5 分钟呼吸练习、坚持一个月，情绪改善和呼吸放慢都比同样时长的正念冥想好。几种呼吸法里，把呼气拉长的「循环叹息」最好。做法是用鼻子吸一口，再补吸一小口把…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/22"},"children":["阅读整个主题：怎么放松：娱乐场所和减压 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-star","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a